      "content": "it doesnt feel like a mistake though. mistakes are things you learn from or fix. this is permanent. i can still see the look on their face, and i know that because of my negligence, their whole world changed for the worse. how can i just \"move on\" or be \"forgiven\" when the damage is done? it feels like i'm just carrying around this heavy, poisoned thing that i don't deserve to keep.",
