    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if there is no growing from this? what if the only thing i'm \"learning\" is how much of a monster i actually am? i don't want to \"grow\" or \"heal\" or go to therapy just to become a better version of something that shouldn't exist. it feels like the more i try to survive, the more i'm just forcing the world to deal with my presence. some things just... they aren't meant to be fixed. they're just broken beyond repair.",
